      "value": "@{5dcae10f2fb049260da562f6|full_name}: Good or higher, actually-- and you can't mark those avatars as fallbacks in the SDK unless it hits those requirements.\nThis is part of the complication, btw. Due to technical reasons, there's no way (currently) for a PC user to know the perf rank of the Quest version of the avatar. That's why we've worked around it in this manner.",
